WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.270
Episode 35

01:53.260 --> 01:55.350
He is saved by people from Beiqi.

01:55.370 --> 01:56.560
Beiqi is in the wrong.

01:56.580 --> 01:57.350
They won't prevent us from

01:57.370 --> 01:58.630
taking Yan Bingyun back.

01:58.650 --> 01:59.750
Beiqi?

01:59.770 --> 02:01.480
Shangshan Hu is Xiao En's adoptive son.

02:01.500 --> 02:02.600
You know him, right?

02:02.620 --> 02:03.940
Your Excellency, are you in contact with him?

02:03.940 --> 02:05.680
I only want to borrow his name.

02:06.540 --> 02:08.320
Grand General sent me to save you.

02:08.340 --> 02:09.900
You're a follower of Hu'er?

02:09.900 --> 02:11.040
Yes.

02:19.210 --> 02:20.840
As long as Nanqing stays unharmed,

02:21.650 --> 02:23.240
I will take any order.

02:23.260 --> 02:24.450
Good.

02:24.540 --> 02:25.260
Later I'll fight Xiao En

02:25.260 --> 02:26.400
with all my strength.

02:26.420 --> 02:28.070
The border is right ahead. We don't have much time.

02:28.090 --> 02:29.530
Let's do it.

02:33.010 --> 02:33.910
Let's get into the woods

02:33.930 --> 02:35.200
and go north.

02:39.570 --> 02:40.260
Leave now!

02:40.260 --> 02:42.200
Grand General is waiting for you ahead.

02:56.730 --> 02:57.930
Xiao En was taken away

02:57.930 --> 02:58.800
by men of Shangshan Hu.

02:58.820 --> 03:00.160
Split up and chase him down.

03:00.180 --> 03:00.880
Yes!

03:00.900 --> 03:02.090
Hurry up!

03:07.340 --> 03:08.760
It's done.

03:13.700 --> 03:14.990
Did anything go wrong?

03:15.010 --> 03:16.160
Your Excellency, you showed up in time.

03:16.180 --> 03:17.810
Xiao En didn't have time to ask.

03:17.980 --> 03:19.120
By calling "Grand General",

03:19.140 --> 03:20.090
everyone thinks

03:20.090 --> 03:21.600
Shangshan Hu's men did it.

03:21.620 --> 03:22.210
It's time for us

03:22.210 --> 03:23.630
to chase him.

03:23.650 --> 03:24.970
Can we catch up with him?

03:25.180 --> 03:27.560
Don't worry. Someone is following him.

04:13.140 --> 04:14.480
Who is there?

04:24.050 --> 04:26.800
Mr. Xiao, you're really vigilant.

04:26.820 --> 04:28.440
Your lightness skill is good.

04:28.460 --> 04:29.870
I'm flattered.

04:29.890 --> 04:31.370
I grow a bit fat recently.

04:31.370 --> 04:33.160
I'm not so flexible.

04:33.700 --> 04:35.880
You set up the iron chains, right?

04:36.460 --> 04:37.920
You're welcome.

04:56.050 --> 04:57.920
You've been leaving marks.

04:58.020 --> 04:59.650
You just keep running. I'll keep doing my job.

04:59.650 --> 05:01.410
Let's stay focused on our own things.

07:13.420 --> 07:15.320
Your Excellency, are you OK?

07:18.090 --> 07:19.370
Your Excellency.

07:28.930 --> 07:32.290
Senior, you're old.

07:47.210 --> 07:49.290
Can he run that way?

07:50.890 --> 07:51.650
Your Excellency, he's not here.

07:51.650 --> 07:54.160
Young Master, which one shall we kill?

07:54.370 --> 07:55.690
He's not here.

07:56.300 --> 07:56.980
Then let's go back.

07:56.980 --> 07:57.910
Nonsense!

07:57.930 --> 08:00.720
Find him! He must be nearby.

08:07.260 --> 08:10.590
You would have been dead back in the old days.

08:10.610 --> 08:12.530
Time and tide wait for no man.

08:16.860 --> 08:19.250
So no one came to save me.

08:19.650 --> 08:21.400
My men pretended to be

08:21.420 --> 08:22.800
Shangshan Hu's men.

08:22.820 --> 08:24.570
Do you lure me out of the mission

08:26.020 --> 08:27.880
to kill me?

08:29.370 --> 08:30.470
I have a question for you.

08:30.490 --> 08:31.970
Go ahead.

08:33.220 --> 08:34.840
Do you know Danzhou?

08:36.290 --> 08:38.330
I grew up in Danzhou as a child.

08:44.930 --> 08:47.250
I see.

08:48.410 --> 08:50.480
Why do you ask me that?

08:52.220 --> 08:53.600
Never mind.

08:55.410 --> 08:57.040
You can kill me now.

09:25.930 --> 09:27.330
Take her!

09:57.050 --> 09:57.680
Your dagger.

09:57.680 --> 09:58.950
=Haitang Duoduo, Saintess of Beiqi=

10:03.700 --> 10:04.610
If you take another step forward,

10:04.610 --> 10:06.330
I'll kill him.

10:07.220 --> 10:08.520
Go ahead.

10:09.220 --> 10:10.830
You're not here to save him.

10:10.850 --> 10:12.080
No, I'm not.

10:12.100 --> 10:14.450
Kill him if you want. I'm just watching.

10:19.050 --> 10:21.010
What's your relationship with Ku He?

10:23.780 --> 10:25.030
So you figured out.

10:25.050 --> 10:26.760
You're Saintess Haitang,

10:26.780 --> 10:28.450
the last apprentice of Ku He.

10:28.970 --> 10:30.480
My name is Haitang Duoduo.

10:31.170 --> 10:32.560
You can call me Haitang,

10:32.580 --> 10:33.960
or Duoduo.

10:36.260 --> 10:37.570
I'm Fan Xian.

10:38.170 --> 10:41.370
I know you, the poetic genius from Nanqing.

10:41.610 --> 10:44.840
Insidious and ruthless at such a young age,

10:46.050 --> 10:47.920
you're not a good man.

10:50.780 --> 10:52.480
Are you also here to kill him?

10:54.410 --> 10:58.250
You can kill him. I'll just stand by and watch.

11:03.020 --> 11:04.890
Fine. Give me the dagger.

11:09.780 --> 11:11.130
Keep an eye on him.

11:24.260 --> 11:25.350
Let's fight.

11:25.370 --> 11:26.770
Are you nuts?

11:27.410 --> 11:28.020
I just told you

11:28.020 --> 11:29.120
I'm not here to save him.

11:29.140 --> 11:30.960
We can talk after the fight.

11:38.490 --> 11:40.370
You must be insane!

11:47.970 --> 11:49.330
Shameless!

12:04.730 --> 12:06.200
If you don't believe me,

12:06.220 --> 12:08.250
you can slash him first.

12:08.730 --> 12:10.370
That makes sense.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.160
Well.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.570
This is for you.

12:53.140 --> 12:55.130
Stop! Stop!

12:57.780 --> 12:59.120
Awesome!

12:59.140 --> 13:00.770
You're really above the Ninth Dan!

13:01.610 --> 13:03.150
Excellent! Excellent!

13:03.170 --> 13:04.050
You're not bad

13:04.050 --> 13:05.590
among the younger generation.

13:05.610 --> 13:07.650
You're so insidious.

13:08.730 --> 13:10.770
I didn't mean to.

13:11.490 --> 13:12.560
Also,

13:12.580 --> 13:13.830
fighting should be simple.

13:13.850 --> 13:15.650
No need to include so many tricks.

13:16.530 --> 13:18.130
Why did you pick a fight with me?

13:18.930 --> 13:20.270
Someone once told me

13:20.290 --> 13:20.850
if I want to

13:20.850 --> 13:21.930
improve my martial arts skills,

13:21.930 --> 13:23.510
I have to fight someone peerless.

13:23.530 --> 13:24.590
You're really good.

13:24.610 --> 13:26.080
It would be a pity not to fight you.

13:26.530 --> 13:27.710
That's all?

13:27.730 --> 13:28.920
What else?

13:32.020 --> 13:33.250
Now that we're done fighting,

13:33.410 --> 13:34.770
you should kill him.

13:46.370 --> 13:48.600
Duoduo,

13:49.260 --> 13:51.370
why do you want to kill him?

13:52.140 --> 13:53.200
My teacher wants to kill him.

13:53.220 --> 13:55.960
Why does Ku He want to kill him?

13:56.050 --> 13:57.600
I don't want to tell you.

13:58.100 --> 13:58.730
Look, we're...

13:58.730 --> 14:00.250
Will you kill him or not?

14:00.290 --> 14:01.720
If you don't, then I will.

14:08.410 --> 14:10.320
He doesn't want to kill me.

14:10.340 --> 14:11.140
If he does,

14:11.140 --> 14:12.840
he would have killed me already.

14:17.930 --> 14:19.880
Senior, you're right.

14:19.900 --> 14:20.820
I've tried so hard

14:20.820 --> 14:22.240
to keep you under my control.

14:22.260 --> 14:24.480
How can I just kill you?

14:31.780 --> 14:33.450
If you really don't want to kill him,

14:33.530 --> 14:34.960
then I'll kill him instead.

14:45.900 --> 14:48.160
Yan Xiaoyi. Director Yan.

14:48.340 --> 14:49.720
Fan Xian,

14:49.930 --> 14:53.450
I'll make you pay today for humiliating me in the capital city.

14:56.220 --> 14:58.120
He was trying to shoot me.

14:58.140 --> 14:59.650
Why did you stop the arrow?

15:01.050 --> 15:02.590
I stopped it subconsciously.

15:02.610 --> 15:04.400
Only after stopping it did I realize that it was coming at you.

15:04.730 --> 15:06.390
That's the Ninth Dan archer of Nanqing.

15:06.410 --> 15:07.440
He's unparalleled in the world.

15:07.460 --> 15:08.350
How is that relevant to me?

15:08.370 --> 15:09.770
Of course it is.

15:10.700 --> 15:12.000
Let me introduce.

15:12.020 --> 15:14.560
This is Haitang Duoduo, Beiqi Saintess.

15:14.580 --> 15:15.390
Director Yan,

15:15.410 --> 15:16.350
by killing the Saintess, you'll make a name

15:16.370 --> 15:18.830
among the frontier soldiers.

15:18.850 --> 15:21.890
Whatever you say, you'll die today.

15:22.610 --> 15:23.830
You should be careful.

15:23.850 --> 15:25.770
I'm afraid Director Yan wants to kill you.

15:26.290 --> 15:27.000
Shameless!

15:27.020 --> 15:28.830
Right, he's shameless!

15:28.850 --> 15:29.970
Later, we should get out together

15:29.970 --> 15:31.810
and look after each other.

15:51.050 --> 15:52.000
War horses?

15:52.020 --> 15:54.130
Yan Xiaoyi has brought the cavalry.

15:54.220 --> 15:54.820
Miss Duoduo,

15:54.820 --> 15:56.480
we can cooperate with each other...

15:58.020 --> 15:59.280
Where is she?

15:59.340 --> 16:00.810
She was here just now.

16:03.850 --> 16:07.040
Your Excellency, the horses are coming.

16:09.340 --> 16:11.450
They are wearing Beiqi uniforms.

16:16.260 --> 16:17.270
What a coincidence!

16:17.290 --> 16:19.320
I just borrowed Shangshan Hu's name,

16:19.340 --> 16:21.040
and here he comes!

16:32.970 --> 16:34.440
It's Beiqi army.

16:34.460 --> 16:35.610
Beiqi army?

16:35.610 --> 16:36.710
Why are they here?

16:36.730 --> 16:38.880
The border is not far ahead.

16:38.900 --> 16:40.890
They must have crossed the border secretly.

16:43.140 --> 16:46.840
=Shangshan Hu, Grand General of Beiqi=
Father, long time no see.

16:48.410 --> 16:50.200
Grand General, if you take another step forward,

16:50.220 --> 16:52.570
you'll only get his dead body.

16:55.610 --> 16:57.890
Is he also here to kill you?

16:59.170 --> 17:00.840
Your Excellency, watch out!

17:40.340 --> 17:42.050
Are those wounds on my father

17:42.290 --> 17:43.890
caused by you?

17:43.930 --> 17:45.480
Another Ninth Dan martial arts master!

17:45.700 --> 17:47.680
I heard you're a poetic genius.

17:48.620 --> 17:49.860
Let me give you a poem for free,

17:49.860 --> 17:51.290
and you should let me go unharmed.

17:51.700 --> 17:53.600
You can keep it as your last will.

17:53.620 --> 17:54.530
The moment I heard of your name,

17:54.530 --> 17:55.870
I couldn't help wondering

17:55.890 --> 17:57.440
whether you're surnamed Shang

17:57.460 --> 17:59.130
or Shangshan.

18:01.530 --> 18:04.480
Man's body rots to nourish all things on earth.

18:04.500 --> 18:08.130
Death is only a start.

18:10.250 --> 18:11.800
That is Fan Xian,

18:12.410 --> 18:13.380
the man I want to kill.

18:13.380 --> 18:15.290
The other is Shangshan Hu,

18:15.340 --> 18:16.600
the Grand General of Beiqi.

18:16.620 --> 18:18.560
Grand General?

18:19.820 --> 18:22.510
If I kill him, will it be counted as a military exploit?

18:22.530 --> 18:24.990
It is equivalent to attacking cities and capturing territories.

18:25.010 --> 18:26.560
If I order you to kill him,

18:27.050 --> 18:28.440
will you be scared?

18:29.250 --> 18:30.750
Wait! Come back!

18:30.770 --> 18:32.480
You're really courageous!

18:32.500 --> 18:34.500
Young Master, let's do it!

18:34.500 --> 18:36.200
Let's wait till Fan Xian is killed.

19:24.530 --> 19:25.050
If I knew,

19:25.050 --> 19:27.050
I wouldn't have engaged myself in the two fights just now.

19:32.620 --> 19:34.050
Wait!

19:38.250 --> 19:39.770
Do you know Danzhou?

19:40.500 --> 19:42.410
I grew up in Danzhou as a child.

19:46.130 --> 19:48.200
Father, would you like to kill him in person?

19:48.650 --> 19:50.170
Don't kill him now.

19:56.580 --> 19:58.030
Why don't they kill him?

19:58.050 --> 19:59.960
Maybe they want to hold him hostage.

20:01.100 --> 20:02.510
He's so lucky!

20:02.530 --> 20:04.510
Are we going back to Beiqi?

20:04.530 --> 20:05.840
Yes.

20:06.100 --> 20:07.910
After all we're within the territory of Nanqing.

20:07.930 --> 20:09.530
We'd better go back as soon as possible.

20:11.620 --> 20:13.080
Take him with us.

20:23.860 --> 20:24.990
Shall we attack?

20:25.010 --> 20:26.560
Fine! Fine! Fine!

20:26.820 --> 20:28.320
You're really fearless.

20:28.700 --> 20:30.630
You're just a group of peasants.

20:30.650 --> 20:31.510
What do you want?

20:31.530 --> 20:32.220
Are you going to confront the Beiqi cavalry

20:32.220 --> 20:33.530
face to face?

20:35.930 --> 20:37.270
Follow them quietly.

20:37.290 --> 20:38.800
We should find a chance to attack.

20:53.100 --> 20:54.680
How long have you been in Danzhou?

20:54.700 --> 20:56.110
Since I was a child.

20:56.130 --> 20:57.230
When did you go back to the capital city?

20:57.250 --> 20:58.680
Not long before.

20:58.890 --> 20:59.980
It's really fast for you to be promoted as Director-General

20:59.980 --> 21:00.990
of the Investigator's Office.

21:01.010 --> 21:02.800
My official career is quite successful.

21:04.500 --> 21:06.250
You're quick at answering questions.

21:06.770 --> 21:08.030
I was caught.

21:08.050 --> 21:09.800
I should be cooperative.

21:12.380 --> 21:13.390
Father,

21:13.410 --> 21:14.750
should we also bring the others?

21:14.770 --> 21:15.960
No need.

21:16.250 --> 21:17.560
I only need him.

21:18.770 --> 21:19.630
Shall we kill them all?

21:19.650 --> 21:21.080
How dare you?

21:24.170 --> 21:27.080
Kill them all!

21:27.860 --> 21:29.010
Really?

21:42.930 --> 21:44.600
Shangshan Hu,

21:44.620 --> 21:46.320
take it easy.

21:46.740 --> 21:48.960
I won't prevent you from saving Xiao En.

21:49.250 --> 21:51.010
I only want him dead.

21:51.980 --> 21:53.770
I can take one more step back.

21:54.130 --> 21:56.130
You can kill him if you want.

21:56.650 --> 21:58.290
After Fan Xian is killed,

21:58.460 --> 21:59.800
I'll leave right away.

21:59.820 --> 22:00.960
As I said,

22:00.980 --> 22:02.680
I have to take him back.

22:03.650 --> 22:05.170
You heard him.

22:07.530 --> 22:08.800
Then you all have to

22:08.820 --> 22:10.600
die here.

22:15.580 --> 22:17.130
Kill them all!

22:24.740 --> 22:26.410
If he doesn't shoot,

22:26.530 --> 22:28.840
Shangshan Hu dares not make a move.

22:28.860 --> 22:30.560
Isn't this a good opportunity?

22:31.580 --> 22:33.130
Father, go north.

22:43.620 --> 22:45.930
Kill the Beiqi bastards!

22:46.980 --> 22:49.010
Kill the Beiqi bastards!

22:54.380 --> 22:55.930
Oh, my God!

22:56.980 --> 22:58.360
It's actually real!

22:58.380 --> 22:59.600
All of us are veterans

22:59.620 --> 23:01.840
retired from the frontiers.

23:01.860 --> 23:03.680
We're most adept

23:04.580 --> 23:06.390
in murdering and robbing

23:06.410 --> 23:07.890
without any mistakes.

23:16.580 --> 23:18.600
Kill Shangshan Hu!

23:30.650 --> 23:33.650
How dare you be distracted when pointed by my arrow?

23:49.770 --> 23:50.850
Fan Xian!

23:51.290 --> 23:52.440
Young Master Guo!

24:01.580 --> 24:02.500
Thank you, Young Master Guo!

24:02.500 --> 24:03.290
Screw you!

24:03.290 --> 24:04.130
This is my dagger.

24:04.130 --> 24:05.340
You actually bring it to me specially!

24:05.340 --> 24:06.800
You villain!

24:14.620 --> 24:17.680
Fan Xian, I'm gonna kill you.

24:18.100 --> 24:18.860
I know! I know!

24:18.860 --> 24:20.010
You're all here to kill me.

24:20.010 --> 24:21.370
Just wait a moment.

24:25.290 --> 24:26.770
Director Yan!

24:28.650 --> 24:29.600
Director Yan,

24:29.620 --> 24:31.530
I'm Guo Baokun, the Imperial Compiler.

24:31.530 --> 24:33.080
I'm also here to kill Fan Xian.

24:33.100 --> 24:34.820
They're veterans from Nanqing.

24:34.820 --> 24:36.050
They are not enemies.

24:36.050 --> 24:37.890
Young Master Guo it is!

24:54.580 --> 24:56.770
Director Yan, what're you doing?

25:05.530 --> 25:06.910
It doesn't make sense.

25:06.930 --> 25:08.680
Yan Xiaoyi must have left the camp without permission.

25:08.700 --> 25:09.870
Why would he leave anyone alive

25:09.890 --> 25:11.370
to put himself at risk?

25:12.580 --> 25:13.460
Keep an eye on them!

25:13.460 --> 25:14.680
Yes.

25:20.100 --> 25:22.030
If you don't stop him,

25:22.050 --> 25:22.960
we'll all be killed

25:22.980 --> 25:24.220
by Yan Xiaoyi.

25:24.220 --> 25:25.890
The Beiqi War God

25:25.930 --> 25:27.750
will die today.

25:27.770 --> 25:28.980
Yan Xiaoyi is the only Ninth Dan archer

25:28.980 --> 25:31.320
in the world.

25:31.410 --> 25:32.800
If you don't kill him now,

25:32.820 --> 25:33.770
countless Beiqi soldiers will be shot dead

25:33.770 --> 25:35.560
on the battlefield in future.

25:35.580 --> 25:37.130
Who can stop me?

25:37.170 --> 25:38.510
It's for the righteous cause of your country,

25:38.530 --> 25:40.320
you can't be intimidated!

26:01.580 --> 26:03.360
My clothes are stained.

26:03.380 --> 26:05.130
Haitang Duoduo!

26:09.500 --> 26:10.870
Nice move.

26:10.890 --> 26:12.110
How do you know I'm here?

26:12.130 --> 26:12.990
I don't.

26:13.010 --> 26:15.440
I just cried out for a try. And I guessed right.

26:18.740 --> 26:19.630
Your Excellency,

26:19.650 --> 26:20.010
I see

26:20.010 --> 26:21.840
guards of the mission coming.

26:23.740 --> 26:24.820
Let's go.

26:25.290 --> 26:27.410
You can't have him.

26:33.100 --> 26:36.080
Miss Duoduo, why are you still here?

26:36.170 --> 26:37.930
I'll leave after I kill Xiao En.

26:38.340 --> 26:40.290
So many people are killed today.

26:41.930 --> 26:43.600
All of them combined

26:43.620 --> 26:45.110
won't be able to stop me.

26:45.130 --> 26:46.750
They won't try to stop you.

26:46.770 --> 26:48.290
The fight is between us.

26:49.650 --> 26:50.870
You're no match for me.

26:50.890 --> 26:53.130
Courage and uprightness are the most
important in fights between warriors.

26:53.130 --> 26:54.320
Even if I'm no match for you,

26:54.340 --> 26:56.370
I'll fight you fairly and openly.

26:56.930 --> 26:58.250
Well said!

26:58.770 --> 27:00.230
I didn't expect you

27:00.250 --> 27:02.290
to be a brave and strong man.

27:02.530 --> 27:04.290
I underestimated you.

27:20.770 --> 27:23.440
You lost. Thank you for letting me win.

27:24.500 --> 27:26.360
Didn't you just say

27:26.380 --> 27:28.150
you would fight me fairly and openly?

27:28.170 --> 27:29.440
I'm a student of Fei Jie.

27:29.460 --> 27:30.230
It's known to everyone that

27:30.250 --> 27:31.340
we fight with

27:31.340 --> 27:32.840
poisons.

27:32.890 --> 27:34.270
Didn't Fei Jie tell you that

27:34.290 --> 27:35.200
poisons are useless to

27:35.220 --> 27:36.630
martial arts masters above the Ninth Dan?

27:36.650 --> 27:38.410
Do you feel hot and flushed

27:38.410 --> 27:39.680
with a racing heart?

27:42.460 --> 27:43.700
Poisons are useless,

27:43.700 --> 27:45.410
but it's not a poison.

27:46.500 --> 27:47.890
Then what is it?

27:47.930 --> 27:49.170
It's an aphrodisiac.

27:49.340 --> 27:50.650
You!

28:01.620 --> 28:02.910
Stop fighting with me!

28:02.930 --> 28:04.770
I never take advantage of others.

28:04.770 --> 28:06.320
Just leave!

29:00.820 --> 29:02.370
I do find it hard

29:02.980 --> 29:04.600
to suppress the heat.

29:04.700 --> 29:06.800
It's really an aphrodisiac.

29:18.010 --> 29:19.320
Hide Xiao En first.

29:19.340 --> 29:20.650
It's too late.

29:22.100 --> 29:22.910
Senior Xiao,

29:22.930 --> 29:23.530
please tell them that

29:23.530 --> 29:24.750
I was the one who caught you.

29:24.770 --> 29:26.250
Now I'm the only one

29:26.250 --> 29:27.230
who wants to save your life.

29:27.250 --> 29:28.080
What about him?

29:28.100 --> 29:29.410
Take him along.

29:41.220 --> 29:44.170
Beiqi tried to rescue Xiao En,

29:44.290 --> 29:46.600
But His Excellency Fan took the lead

29:46.620 --> 29:48.720
and brought Xiao En back.

29:48.860 --> 29:51.270
So, please be relieved.

29:51.290 --> 29:52.680
Don't worry.

29:52.980 --> 29:54.510
Let's take a short break

29:54.530 --> 29:55.800
and set off right away.

29:55.820 --> 29:56.770
-OK! -OK!

29:56.770 --> 29:58.750
It's really not easy for His Excellency Fan.

29:58.770 --> 30:00.680
He chased Xiao En all the way!

30:05.010 --> 30:07.650
Senior, please get on the carriage.

30:08.050 --> 30:09.480
Kill the members of the mission,

30:09.500 --> 30:11.130
and I'll tell you anything

30:11.220 --> 30:13.130
you want to know.

30:13.290 --> 30:15.010
I do want to catch you,

30:15.250 --> 30:17.080
but I don't want to betray my country.

30:17.100 --> 30:18.480
Senior Xiao,

30:18.500 --> 30:20.230
chance is easily missed.

30:20.250 --> 30:22.200
Just behave yourself and get on the carriage.

30:22.460 --> 30:24.650
There's still a chance.

30:26.170 --> 30:28.080
I've been curious.

30:28.290 --> 30:29.630
I didn't kill you

30:29.650 --> 30:30.580
because of your

30:30.580 --> 30:32.200
hidden secret.

30:32.650 --> 30:35.080
But why didn't you kill me?

30:36.580 --> 30:38.410
What's so special in Danzhou

30:38.530 --> 30:40.150
to keep a ruthless man like you

30:40.170 --> 30:41.680
from killing me?

30:43.100 --> 30:44.680
The black knights didn't show up

30:44.700 --> 30:46.680
throughout the whole process.

30:48.530 --> 30:51.170
If Chen Pingping really cares about you,

30:52.100 --> 30:53.960
how can he forget about this?

30:55.250 --> 30:57.200
You should be careful.

30:57.650 --> 30:58.890
We're about to arrive in Beiqi,

30:58.890 --> 31:00.010
but Shangshan Hu still led his men

31:00.010 --> 31:01.390
to attack the mission.

31:01.410 --> 31:02.840
It's obvious that some people

31:02.860 --> 31:04.360
from the imperial court of Beiqi want to take your life.

31:04.380 --> 31:05.960
You should also be careful.

31:16.380 --> 31:17.930
Find more allies.

31:18.460 --> 31:19.910
Don't rely solely on

31:19.930 --> 31:21.800
Chen Pingping.

31:37.890 --> 31:38.840
Your Excellency, feel relieved.

31:38.860 --> 31:40.410
I've handled everything.

31:41.820 --> 31:42.630
Have you noticed any trace of

31:42.650 --> 31:44.080
the black knights around?

31:45.930 --> 31:47.200
No.

31:47.930 --> 31:49.170
Where's Guo Baokun?

31:49.700 --> 31:50.960
He's over there.

31:51.250 --> 31:51.960
He just sits still

31:51.980 --> 31:53.510
after reaching the campsite.

31:53.530 --> 31:54.800
The black knights are not here.

31:54.820 --> 31:56.150
Head must have

31:56.170 --> 31:58.600
forgotten about it.

32:19.100 --> 32:20.270
Your men are

32:20.290 --> 32:21.750
all buried.

32:21.770 --> 32:23.910
Bold with good martial arts skills,

32:23.930 --> 32:25.440
they must have joined the army.

32:25.620 --> 32:26.380
I gathered them

32:26.380 --> 32:27.800
to kill you.

32:28.410 --> 32:29.680
Why do you want to kill me?

32:29.890 --> 32:31.230
For my dad.

32:31.250 --> 32:32.150
Your dad is dead?

32:32.170 --> 32:33.360
Nonsense!

32:33.380 --> 32:34.010
Since he's not dead,

32:34.010 --> 32:34.960
why do you hate me?

32:34.980 --> 32:36.340
My dad was sent to jail because of you.

32:36.340 --> 32:36.860
Then why did you

32:36.860 --> 32:37.860
attack Shangshan Hu?

32:37.860 --> 32:38.930
I want to kill you both!

32:38.930 --> 32:40.110
Why do you want to kill Shangshan Hu?

32:40.130 --> 32:40.750
By killing him,

32:40.770 --> 32:42.390
I can use my military exploit to get my dad out of jail.

32:42.410 --> 32:43.170
Now that Shangshan Hu is still alive,

32:43.170 --> 32:43.960
how can you get your dad out?

32:43.980 --> 32:45.170
I...

32:49.220 --> 32:50.600
I'll offer you two choices.

32:50.770 --> 32:53.530
One is to kill me right now.

32:54.460 --> 32:55.130
I'll take this one.

32:55.130 --> 32:56.840
The other is to let me get your dad out of jail.

33:05.250 --> 33:06.580
We don't bear deep hatred against each other.

33:06.580 --> 33:07.890
Nonsense!

33:08.010 --> 33:08.740
You beat me.

33:08.740 --> 33:10.080
You don't hate me for sure.

33:10.100 --> 33:11.630
I was caught by Shangshan Hu today.

33:11.650 --> 33:12.480
Anyhow,

33:12.500 --> 33:14.360
thanks to you, I escaped.

33:14.380 --> 33:16.600
I kind of owe you.

33:16.740 --> 33:17.960
How about this?

33:17.980 --> 33:19.480
I'll make you a deal.

33:19.740 --> 33:21.560
When we go back to the capital city with Yan Bingyun,

33:21.580 --> 33:23.050
I'll personally beg His Majesty

33:23.050 --> 33:24.230
to release your dad.

33:24.250 --> 33:25.250
Why would His Majesty listen to you?

33:25.250 --> 33:26.130
He won't

33:26.130 --> 33:27.270
if the Princess Royal is still in the capital city.

33:27.290 --> 33:28.130
But now Li Yunrui

33:28.130 --> 33:29.320
has been kicked out of the capital city,

33:29.340 --> 33:30.250
your father's sin of forming a clique

33:30.250 --> 33:31.870
matters nothing.

33:31.890 --> 33:32.620
What tricks

33:32.620 --> 33:34.080
are you playing this time?

33:34.100 --> 33:35.290
I have conditions.

33:36.130 --> 33:37.840
When we return to the capital city,

33:38.010 --> 33:39.440
you should personally

33:39.460 --> 33:40.890
accuse Yan Xiaoyi of colluding with Beiqi

33:40.890 --> 33:42.290
to assassinate the mission members.

33:46.100 --> 33:47.270
Stop hesitating!

33:47.290 --> 33:48.250
Even if you don't testify against him,

33:48.250 --> 33:50.290
Yan Xiaoyi will also try to kill you.

33:53.100 --> 33:54.440
What else do you want?

33:54.620 --> 33:55.930
After your dad is released,

33:55.930 --> 33:57.930
your family should ally with me

33:58.170 --> 34:00.010
and share connections with me.

34:00.250 --> 34:03.170
Nobody cared when my dad was put in jail.

34:04.650 --> 34:06.560
We have no connections.

34:06.580 --> 34:08.930
It's natural that no one cares about
you when you're down and out.

34:09.490 --> 34:11.450
Once your father is released,

34:11.860 --> 34:13.750
your former friends and relatives

34:13.770 --> 34:15.690
will swarm to visit you.

34:15.730 --> 34:17.890
It's a cold world after all.

34:19.100 --> 34:21.690
You have the support of Chen Pingping
from the Investigator's Office.

34:22.380 --> 34:24.690
Why do you need our support?

34:25.050 --> 34:27.170
Just tell me yes or no.

34:29.290 --> 34:30.650
Will anyone else help you

34:31.380 --> 34:33.450
but me?

35:11.180 --> 35:12.230
We're about to leave.

35:12.250 --> 35:13.600
Aren't you going back to your carriage?

35:14.530 --> 35:16.040
An aphrodisiac?

35:16.580 --> 35:18.800
How do you know that?

35:20.820 --> 35:22.750
Taking an aphrodisiac along with you,

35:22.770 --> 35:25.000
you're really no gentleman.

35:26.820 --> 35:28.410
Your Excellency,

35:28.660 --> 35:31.320
I'm the only girl in the mission.

35:31.730 --> 35:33.880
By bringing the aphrodisiac along,

35:33.900 --> 35:36.040
whom do you plan to use it on?

35:36.340 --> 35:37.140
Well...

35:37.140 --> 35:39.080
it's not what you think.

35:46.280 --> 35:47.510
Your Excellency!

35:49.240 --> 35:51.030
Yan Xiaoyi.

35:53.000 --> 35:54.390
Help!

36:06.080 --> 36:07.550
You're awake.

36:08.080 --> 36:09.910
Luckily, your internal organs are unharmed.

36:10.640 --> 36:12.150
It was Yan Xiaoyi.

36:12.920 --> 36:14.460
I was too careless.

36:14.480 --> 36:15.680
I thought it was all settled.

36:15.680 --> 36:17.300
I didn't expect him to return.

36:17.320 --> 36:19.590
It's really hard to guard against the
assassination of a Ninth Dan archer.

36:19.760 --> 36:20.820
He's also injured,

36:20.840 --> 36:21.520
so your wound is not deep.

36:21.520 --> 36:22.760
He won't come back in a short time.

36:22.760 --> 36:24.150
You'll be fine.

36:25.120 --> 36:26.540
Your Excellency.

36:26.560 --> 36:28.030
What do you need?

36:29.840 --> 36:31.790
Who took off

36:32.640 --> 36:34.310
my clothes?

36:41.520 --> 36:42.080
Well...

36:42.080 --> 36:43.120
I'm the only one in the mission

36:43.120 --> 36:45.630
who's proficient in medicine.

36:45.960 --> 36:48.350
Your wounds had to be taken care of.

36:49.200 --> 36:51.070
All of my clothes?

36:52.120 --> 36:53.830
I had to bind up your wounds.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.670
It's an act out of emergency.

36:58.120 --> 36:59.740
You bring medicine along.

36:59.760 --> 37:01.080
It's not an aphrodisiac.

37:01.080 --> 37:02.500
Whatever you say.

37:02.520 --> 37:04.180
It's really not.

37:04.200 --> 37:04.980
Then what is it?

37:05.000 --> 37:06.270
Your Excellency.

37:07.960 --> 37:09.270
What's up?

37:09.520 --> 37:12.310
Just get off and see yourself.

37:23.480 --> 37:25.470
Your Excellency, shall we fight?

37:26.880 --> 37:28.310
We stand no chance.

37:31.200 --> 37:32.950
We can use a strong crossbow.

37:36.040 --> 37:37.630
Don't follow me.

37:39.280 --> 37:40.470
Your Excellency.

37:47.240 --> 37:48.500
You've dried your clothes with internal force.

37:48.520 --> 37:49.830
Did you jump into a river?

37:50.400 --> 37:52.540
Come with me. Alone.

37:52.560 --> 37:53.790
This way.

38:01.280 --> 38:03.110
That woman is really good at martial arts.

38:04.200 --> 38:05.430
Never mind.

38:06.240 --> 38:07.580
His Excellency asked us

38:07.600 --> 38:09.020
to wait here.

38:09.040 --> 38:10.140
Wang,

38:10.160 --> 38:11.780
I'm just worried.

38:11.800 --> 38:12.620
No need.

38:12.640 --> 38:13.940
Gorgeous as he is,

38:13.960 --> 38:15.180
I actually feel that

38:15.200 --> 38:17.040
the Beiqi Saintess

38:17.040 --> 38:18.790
has fallen for him.

38:19.320 --> 38:20.600
She is going to confess her love

38:20.600 --> 38:22.470
in private.

38:23.280 --> 38:24.900
His Excellency drugged her,

38:24.920 --> 38:26.380
yet she falls for him?

38:26.400 --> 38:28.190
The drug is the key.

38:28.240 --> 38:30.340
His Excellency is a student of Fei Jie.

38:30.360 --> 38:33.350
That aphrodisiac must be exceptional.

38:33.760 --> 38:35.750
The Saintess must have really

38:36.240 --> 38:38.510
fallen in love with him.

38:38.920 --> 38:40.710
How can there be such drugs?

38:41.880 --> 38:44.470
His Excellency has many specialties.

38:44.600 --> 38:46.470
Just follow me.

38:46.760 --> 38:49.590
I'll answer your questions.

38:49.920 --> 38:51.390
OK.

39:05.760 --> 39:06.620
Give me the antidote.

39:06.640 --> 39:07.360
Listen to me.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.860
I'll kill you if you say another word.

39:08.880 --> 39:10.150
It's not an aphrodisiac.

39:10.920 --> 39:12.380
I'm telling the truth.

39:12.400 --> 39:13.180
Just think about it.

39:13.200 --> 39:14.460
I was after Xiao En.

39:14.480 --> 39:15.080
In that case,

39:15.080 --> 39:16.830
why did I bring an aphrodisiac?

39:20.360 --> 39:21.630
Then what is it?

39:22.160 --> 39:22.780
Why...

39:22.800 --> 39:24.080
Why did it make you hot and flushed

39:24.080 --> 39:25.060
with a racing heart?

39:25.080 --> 39:26.480
Actually, I made the drug myself

39:26.480 --> 39:27.940
to boost metabolism

39:27.960 --> 39:29.230
and increase energy.

39:29.800 --> 39:31.470
What is metabolism?

39:35.000 --> 39:36.380
Let me put it this way.

39:36.400 --> 39:38.380
If you take this drug after getting injured,

39:38.400 --> 39:40.060
it can unleash your potential

39:40.080 --> 39:41.100
so as to maintain your military strength.

39:41.120 --> 39:42.160
It's not a poison.

39:42.160 --> 39:43.910
Instead, it's good for health.

39:44.080 --> 39:45.180
Your heart raced

39:45.200 --> 39:46.100
because of the drug.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.560
You may feel hot,

39:47.560 --> 39:48.960
but your reaction ability can be greatly improved.

39:48.960 --> 39:50.390
Did you feel that?

39:51.120 --> 39:52.910
You lied to me previously.

39:54.120 --> 39:55.060
If I didn't say that,

39:55.080 --> 39:56.940
you would kill me right away.

39:56.960 --> 39:58.870
Weren't you afraid that I might see through your lie?

39:59.360 --> 40:01.590
I suppose you had no experience.

40:03.040 --> 40:03.480
Why do you tell me

40:03.480 --> 40:04.910
the truth now?

40:05.200 --> 40:06.760
I'm a gentleman.

40:06.760 --> 40:08.100
How can I lie to you?

40:08.120 --> 40:09.790
Bullshit!

40:09.960 --> 40:11.580
If I don't tell you the truth,

40:11.600 --> 40:13.390
you might kill me just now.

40:13.480 --> 40:14.990
I can still kill you now.

40:17.920 --> 40:19.270
You won't.

40:23.120 --> 40:24.870
Then just go to hell.

40:25.640 --> 40:27.270
You won't kill me.

40:28.760 --> 40:30.260
Why are you so sure?

40:30.280 --> 40:31.600
Everyone saw you take me away from

40:31.600 --> 40:33.220
the official road just now.

40:33.240 --> 40:34.910
If I die,

40:35.200 --> 40:37.640
Nanqing will definitely launch a war against Beiqi.

40:37.640 --> 40:39.380
You're the Saintess of Beiqi.

40:39.400 --> 40:40.280
Would you like to

40:40.280 --> 40:41.780
see your people suffer?

40:41.800 --> 40:43.020
I can kill you first.

40:43.040 --> 40:44.910
Then I'll kill everyone in your mission.

40:45.080 --> 40:46.790
You're not bloodthirsty.

40:48.280 --> 40:49.630
How could you know?

40:50.320 --> 40:52.390
If you are,

40:52.480 --> 40:53.840
you wouldn't let me

40:53.840 --> 40:54.860
kill Xiao En.

40:54.880 --> 40:56.670
You would definitely kill him yourself.

40:56.760 --> 40:57.780
Also,

40:57.800 --> 40:59.540
you wouldn't bother

40:59.560 --> 41:00.990
asking me for the antidote.

41:03.760 --> 41:04.820
Would you like a bite?

41:04.840 --> 41:06.670
You're really a piece of work!

41:19.760 --> 41:21.270
Aren't you afraid it might be drugged?

41:21.600 --> 41:22.460
It's sweet.

41:22.480 --> 41:23.660
Of course.

41:23.680 --> 41:24.720
It's our gift

41:24.720 --> 41:25.200
for the imperial family

41:25.200 --> 41:26.620
of Beiqi.

41:26.640 --> 41:28.350
I took it out from the mission.

41:46.640 --> 41:48.070
Wang,

41:48.480 --> 41:50.870
why does it take so long?

41:51.360 --> 41:54.030
It makes sense that they're not back yet.

41:58.360 --> 42:00.710
What do you mean?

42:02.160 --> 42:03.590
Just think about it.

42:03.880 --> 42:06.700
That Beiqi Saintess is a martial arts master.

42:06.720 --> 42:08.500
If she wants to kill His Excellency,

42:08.520 --> 42:09.740
how could it take so long?

42:09.760 --> 42:11.400
They must have a good talk

42:11.400 --> 42:13.600
and become friends already.

42:13.600 --> 42:15.990
That's too fast!

42:23.000 --> 42:24.740
Amazing!

42:24.760 --> 42:26.500
Amiable as His Excellency is,

42:26.520 --> 42:30.230
they might be eating fruits together.

42:42.720 --> 42:44.230
Are you really the Saintess?

43:07.080 --> 43:10.660
In the river of history,

43:10.680 --> 43:14.150
time goes round and round.

43:16.960 --> 43:20.300
Memories about the former and present lives

43:20.320 --> 43:24.390
join each other in an endless way.

43:26.280 --> 43:28.900
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:28.920 --> 43:31.160
one season follows another in a flash,

43:31.160 --> 43:33.660
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:33.680 --> 43:35.280
I just can't give up

43:35.280 --> 43:38.620
to be with you for my whole life.

43:38.640 --> 43:44.110
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:45.360 --> 43:47.910
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:48.200 --> 43:50.240
Year after year in the wandering,

43:50.240 --> 43:52.900
I count the remaining years.

43:52.920 --> 43:55.100
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:55.120 --> 43:57.110
even though we have ended up the destiny,

43:57.400 --> 43:59.790
I never feel regretful.

43:59.840 --> 44:01.200
In such a chaotic world,

44:01.200 --> 44:04.180
I still miss you as ever.

44:04.200 --> 44:07.150
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:07.440 --> 44:09.500
With a gentle heart,

44:09.520 --> 44:12.180
I cherish our remaining years.

44:12.200 --> 44:13.720
Even though we have to go through

44:13.720 --> 44:16.230
all the hardships along the journey,

44:16.360 --> 44:23.550
you always stay by my side,

44:23.640 --> 44:26.310
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:26.600 --> 44:28.680
Year after year in the wandering,

44:28.680 --> 44:31.340
I count the remaining years.

44:31.360 --> 44:33.500
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:33.520 --> 44:35.750
even though we end up the destiny,

44:35.960 --> 44:38.140
I never feel regretful.

44:38.160 --> 44:39.560
In such a chaotic world,

44:39.560 --> 44:42.620
I still miss you as ever.

44:42.640 --> 44:45.750
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:45.840 --> 44:47.980
With a gentle heart,

44:48.000 --> 44:50.700
I cherish our remaining years.

44:50.720 --> 44:52.160
Even though we have to go through

44:52.160 --> 44:54.820
all the hardships along the journey,

44:54.840 --> 45:03.600
you always stay by my side...
